"50.041" end="52.075">总感觉很窝</span><span begin="52.075" end="52.758">心</span></p><p begin="52.822" end="59.085" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.822" end="55.211">日子像旋转木</span><span begin="55.211" end="55.782">马</span> <span begin="56.064" end="58.418">在脑海里转不</span><span begin="58.418" end="59.085">停</span></p><p begin="59.253" end="1:04.512" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.253" end="1:00.858">出现那些</span><span begin="1:00.858" end="1:02.794">你对我好的</span><span begin="1:02.794" end="1:03.261">场</span><span begin="1:03.261" end="1:04.512">景</span></p></div><div begin="1:06.486" end="1:31.655" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:06.486" end="1:12.279" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.486" end="1:07.197">你</span><span begin="1:07.197" end="1:09.632">说过牵了手就</span><span begin="1:09.632" end="1:10.834">算</span><span begin="1:10.834" end="1:11.284">约</span><span begin="1:11.284" end="1:12.279">定</span></p><p begin="1:12.796" end="1:18.850" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.796" end="1:13.633">但</span><span begin="1:13.633" end="1:16.007">亲爱的那并不</span><span begin="1:16.007" end="1:17.235">是</span><span begin="1:17.235" end="1:17.653">爱</span><span begin="1:17.653" end="1:18.850">情</span></p><p begin="1:19.228" end="1:25.018" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.228" end="1:19.942">就</span><span begin="1:19.942" end="1:22.496">像来不及许愿</span><span begin="1:22.496" end="1:23.663">的</span><span begin="1:23.663" end="1:24.063">流</span><span begin="1:24.063" end="1:25.018">星</span></p><p begin="1:25.589" end="1:31.655" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.589" end="1:26.814">再怎么</span><span begin="1:26.814" end="1:28.866">美丽也只能</span><span begin="1:28.866" end="1:30.036">是</span><span begin="1:30.036" end="1:30.419">曾</span><span begin="1:30.419" end="1:31.655">经</span></p></div><div begin="1:32.017" end="1:56.557" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:32.017" end="1:37.809" itunes:key="L13" ttm:ag